  "prefLabel": "Alc 409.03 Requirements for Licensed Clinical Supervisors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 409.03 Requirements for Licensed Clinical Supervisors. As a condition of renewal, licensed clinical supervisors shall complete at least 6 hours of training in clinical supervision during each 2 year license period, provided that licensees shall be permitted to incorporate these 6 hours into the hours needed for licensure renewal under Alc 409.02.\n\nSource. #12548, eff 7-1-18; ss by #14045, eff 10-7-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/alc100-500.html"
